  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.8.1:\n      - Adds mediator analyzer warnings for missing handlers, duplicate handlers, ambiguous request contracts, missing stream handlers, and singleton handler lifetime risks.\n      - Keeps analyzer rules source-only, generator-free, and code-fix-free.\n      - Expands analyzer docs, tests, and release verification for the 1.8.x analyzer lane.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
